cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "innovate: A Python library for simplifying innovation and policy diffusion modelling"
abstract: >
  innovate is a comprehensive, modular Python library for modeling the diffusion,
  substitution, competition, and dynamics of innovations, technologies, and policies
  over time. It provides a flexible framework for researchers and practitioners in
  economics, marketing, public policy, and technology forecasting, supporting
  everything from classic S-curve models to advanced agent-based simulations.
